      "Domain scaling, true energy and actual Riesz weak-dual subsequences plus WithLp2 double orthogonal prove both strong scaled function and gradient limits. Ordinary product has maxnorm and is not silently used as Hilbert product. No supplied cluster/graph/limit certificate/Poincare or uniform unscaled solution bound.",
      "Actual finite-dimensional Borel E including0 and true normalized tilted Gibbs probability derive genuine scalarL2 separability. C1 W/exponential integrability suffice generically; source consumer retains C2 alpha/beta/eta cap/reflected law and positive partitions.",
      "Same original exact compact-smooth closable D beforeALL f/epsilon; construct actual variational solutions and retain ordinary localintegrability/legal compactC1 directionalweak tests. True fL2 implies actualL1; actual meanzero and SAME kernelAEconstant give kernelorthogonality, not a hypothesis that resolvent u is centered.",
      "True common Gaussian/disintegrating/reflected J/R/S and original D_y precede allforcing/epsilon queries. Rewrite only literal S_y normalized density equality. No R2=R, alternateD or jointlymeasurable selector.",
      "Only scaled-resolvent residualnorm limit is claimed; unscaled solution/range/epsilon0/Poincare/BL/scorevariance/adjoint/core/SPHMC Hessian lower/both main/composition remainopen. TV nevertransfers unboundedcost."
    ],
